4134
06:47:10,388 --> 06:47:13,508
readability, terminology,

4135
06:47:14,008 --> 06:47:17,808
metadata completeness and richness, taxonomic

4136
06:47:17,868 --> 06:47:21,708
backbone, unique identifiers, fairness,

4137
06:47:22,148 --> 06:47:24,588
reproducibility, and plus

4138
06:47:26,048 --> 06:47:26,368
task

4139
06:47:27,748 --> 06:47:31,148
performance and task specificity,

4140
06:47:31,868 --> 06:47:34,968
context information, clear authorship,

4141
06:47:35,868 --> 06:47:38,128
usage history, and reliability.

